dium-sized rectangular meeting room with a long table, 10 gray office chairs, floor-to-ceiling windows with horizontal blinds, a projector screen, and a cool gray monochrome palette.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video shows <Subject 1> standing before the projector screen in <Subject 8> wearing a white shirt instead of his usual hoodie. <Subject 5> asks who he is, <Subject 4> introduces him. Instead of starting the PPT, <Subject 1> sits down across from <Subject 5> and asks to pose a question first.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): attribute_modified - Chen Mo's facial features, hair, and body type are fully retained from the reference image. The costume is modified from gray hoodie to a white button-up shirt with rolled-up sleeves and a stopped old wristwatch on the left wrist, as specified by the script.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - Su Nian sits in the corner, her appearance retained.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - Wang Defa holds his thermos, his appearance retained.\n<Subject 4> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2]): fully_preserved - Zhao Jianguo's appearance and concerned expression are retained.\n<Subject 5> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - Han Zong's appearance and evaluating expression are retained.\n<Subject 8> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - the meeting room layout, long table, blinds, and projector screen are retained.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video uses a cinematic, live-action urban drama style with corporate meeting-room lighting, cool tones, and striped light from horizontal blinds. The atmosphere shifts from skeptical anticipation to intrigued tension.\n[Shot 1] A medium-wide establishing shot of <Subject 8>, the Star Media meeting room. <Subject 4>, Zhao Jianguo, <Subject 3>, Wang Defa, and <Subject 2>, Su Nian, sit on one side of the long table. <Subject 5>, Han Zong, sits on the opposite side with his assistant. <Subject 1>, Chen Mo, stands before the projector screen. He is notably wearing a clean white button-up shirt with sleeves rolled to the elbows — a stark contrast to his usual gray hoodie. A stopped old wristwatch is visible on his left wrist. All eyes are on him. The camera holds on the full room for a beat, establishing the tension. Han Zong (S5), a senior man with a deep, authoritative voice, leans back in his chair and says: <d>[Chinese] 这位是……？</d> Zhao Jianguo (S4) responds immediately: <d>[Chinese] 韩总，这就是写方案的人。陈默。</d> [Shot 2] At 00:05.000, the camera cuts to a medium shot of <Subject 5>, Han Zong, who studies <Subject 1> with a measured gaze. He shows no expression of approval or disinterest. Han Zong (S5) says simply: <d>[Chinese] 讲吧。</d> [Shot 3] At 00:07.000, the camera cuts to a medium shot of <Subject 1>. He does not immediately reach for the presentation remote. Instead, he walks around the table and sits down directly across from <Subject 5>. The camera tracks his movement. <Subject 4>'s brow furrows. <Subject 3> smirks slightly, as if expecting failure. Chen Mo (S1), a young man in his twenties, says in a calm, unhurried voice: <d>[Chinese] 韩总，在讲方案之前，我想先问您一个问题。</d> The camera holds on the room's reaction — surprise, skepticism, anticipation — as the video ends.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nThe room is quiet with only the low HVAC hum. Chairs creak slightly as people shift. Han Zong's voice is deep and measured. Chen Mo's footsteps are soft on the carpet as he walks to sit down. The chair pulls out and settles with a muted thud.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA steady, grounded cello drone begins at low volume, establishing a serious, dignified tone. A subtle low-string harmony builds underneath as Chen Mo sits down across from Han Zong, creating a sense of quiet confidence against the skepticism."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags":